Rep. Eulogio "Leo" R. Rodriguez: canceled ang bookings, damaged establishments,

2017
02:12:08,810 --> 02:12:10,810
Rep. Eulogio "Leo" R. Rodriguez: at nawala ng kita.

2018
02:12:10,810 --> 02:12:12,810
Rep. Eulogio "Leo" R. Rodriguez: Ang pinaka-vulnerable dito yung small resorts.

